  "description": "<h2 class=\"image-with-text__heading inline-richtext h2\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); line-height: calc(1 + 0.3/max(1,var(--font-heading-scale))); word-break: break-word; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 2.4rem); align-self: flex-start; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">VICTORIA'S JOURNALS</h2>\r\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text rte body\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; align-self: flex-start; text-align: left; margin-top: 2rem; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">is a fashionable brand with timeless appeal, providing a wide range of stationery and fashion objects to people in more than 20 countries around the world.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Our finely crafted high-end collections include: journals, diaries, planners, totes, wallets, fashion accessories and more, all designed to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle. We take pride in offering personalized products that cater to your unique needs. We use high-quality recycled and vegan leather and other eco-friendly materials, ensuring the durability and longevity of anything coming under the name of Victoria&rsquo;s Journals. Our paper is being carefully preselected to cater to the demands of our fountain-pen followers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">We offer finely embossed and printed designs that add a touch of sophistication to your everyday life.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">We are all on a beautiful journey called LIFE and taking notes while travelling is fun. Let Victoria's Journals accompany in your journey...</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Write True. Speak True.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">&bull; Payment terms: 1 week</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">&bull; Product description: high-end journals, noteboks, diaries, bullet journals, 5 year diaries, pencil cases and pouches, writing instruments, etc.<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Fashionable colours and excuisite cover materials that noone else is using. We are always aheaad of our competitors.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;==========================================</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><br></p>",
